{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54479","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 二十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 二十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太平世，积食（京本作「粟」）养雄兵。\n不可辄忘征战意（京本作「备」），常时论武（京本作「常须讲习」）使兵（辛本、川本作「令」）精，防寇犯（京本作「彼寇」）边庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}